### get by name
GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses/search?name=Data&page3&size=2

### get students by course id

GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/students?page=0&size=2
### create

POST  http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Y3VzdG9tZXI6Y3VzdG9tZXI=

{
    "name":"Java basics",
    "description": "Learn the basics of Java programming",
    "capacity":11
}


###

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/courses/20
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Y3VzdG9tZXI6Y3VzdG9tZXI=

{
    "name": "Data Structures 5 Updated",
    "description": "Learn advanced data structures - Updated",
    "capacity":20
}

### set status active/inactive

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/courses/15/status?active=true

